  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The \"informative HUD\" obscures screen space which is traditionally world creator territory. Any legacy world/game with a screen space UI would get covered up. Forcing world makers to display a notice \"please turn off HUD\" at start is immersion breaking and add friction to gameplay with no guaranteed result. It ruins the worlds, it ruins player experience, it ruins VRChat the brand because of how clunky the experience is, or rather, becoming more clunkier than before.\n\nKill this bloat before it has a chance to mutate.",
